{"version":1,"id":"polo-g-21","title":"21","artist":"Polo G","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/polo-g/21/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Khaled Rohaim, Taurus Barlett and Keanu Beats","chords":[{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Decorate your block with red tape, foenem slidin' every day","columns":59,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Bunch of hollows spittin' out the Glock","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I been servin' fiends all day, out there posted with the gang","columns":61,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga, we was taught to get it off the block","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a hundred bands in the safe, now I got expensive taste","columns":59,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Mike Amiri jeans, fill 'em up with knots","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I been on my grind every day, don't believe in takin' breaks","columns":60,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't stoppin' 'til we chillin' at the top","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 1]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Swervin' on the E-way, don't care if I crash in this coupe","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Shit I'm thinkin' 'bout too real, might lose my mind in this coupe","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":30,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Can't relapse off these drugs, man, R.I.P. to Juice","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"We was tweakin' off them Percs, I popped my last one with you","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":27,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":59,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Bond tight with my day ones, ain't tryna find no recruits","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"We was playin' give and take on that front line with my troops","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":59,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Ayy, like who want smoke? We got plenty guns","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Keep two lil' savages on X and they gon' get it done","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"And them hollow tips do surgery, they gon' clip his lungs","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"It was goin' down on the set, that's when this shit was fun","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":48,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"I just been ballin' on these niggas like I'm Kendrick Nunn","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Every day my birthday, bitch, it's lit, I just turned twenty-one","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":59,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Decorate your block with red tape, foenem slidin' every day","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Bunch of hollows spittin' out the Glock","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I been servin' fiends all day, out there posted with the gang","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga, we was taught to get it off the block","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a hundred bands in the safe, now I got expensive taste","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Mike Amiri jeans, fill 'em up with knots","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I been on my grind every day, don't believe in takin' breaks","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't stoppin' 'til we chillin' at the top","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Ever since I stepped up in this game, I've been a bomb threat","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"I was in the trenches, tryna see a life beyond that","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause complacent niggas usually die up in they complex","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga, where I'm from, they turn death into a contest","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Livin' by the gun, put all my trust into this compact","columns":53,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"My niggas went to war, but they ain't get no Vietnam check","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Lil' bro want his head, he tryna make his brains ooze","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Lil' bitch, I'm from the Northside where they raise goons","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":29,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":54,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"Took losses in these streets, shit got me singin' gang blues","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"I been a real nigga 'fore this shit became cool","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm the type to switch my watch up every time I change moods","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"He the type to get excited 'cause he made The Shade Room","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":54,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"Decorate your block with red tape, foenem slidin' every day","columns":59,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"Bunch of hollows spittin' out the Glock","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"I been servin' fiends all day, out there posted with the gang","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga, we was taught to get it off the block","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a hundred bands in the safe, now I got expensive taste","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"Mike Amiri jeans, fill 'em up with knots","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"I been on my grind every day, don't believe in takin' breaks","columns":60,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't stoppin' 'til we chillin' at the top","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]}]}